l3: Check the function bodies in the L3 agent

Annotate agent_state and heartbeat where init_host() assigns them, so
mypy can type their reads in _report_state(). The legacy state change
check raises a RuntimeError naming process_monitor if it is unset,
inside the try that already logs and skips any failure to register.

